      "content": "Then maybe this cliff *is* your destination—a place to finally let go of the idea that you must keep moving. Even a cliff can hold you if you choose to sit with it, letting the silence be the completion rather than a pause. If this is where the road ends, perhaps it was always meant to end here so you could learn to exist without a path. That alone is a kind of arrival.",
